2f:["$","section","3-Prepare financial evidence without guessing an award amount",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare financial evidence without guessing an award amount"}],[["$","p","Build a private evidence folder for household income, expenses, assets, dependants and available support. Keep the underlying documents and record the period and currency used. An unexplained mismatch between an essay and a financial form can be harder to resolve than a modest but accurately documented budget.",{"children":"Build a private evidence folder for household income, expenses, assets, dependants and available support. Keep the underlying documents and record the period and currency used. An unexplained mismatch between an essay and a financial form can be harder to resolve than a modest but accurately documented budget."}],["$","p","Do not treat the estimated award as money already available. Calculate the cost of attendance and the resources your family can actually contribute, then explain the difference consistently. Ask UBC how to document irregular income or unavailable records rather than inventing a salary or a conversion rate.",{"children":"Do not treat the estimated award as money already available. Calculate the cost of attendance and the resources your family can actually contribute, then explain the difference consistently. Ask UBC how to document irregular income or unavailable records rather than inventing a salary or a conversion rate."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"An original worksheet structure for checking your evidence","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"An original worksheet structure for checking your evidence"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Budget entry",{"scope":"col","children":"Budget entry"}],["$","th","Evidence to collect",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence to collect"}],["$","th","Consistency check",{"scope":"col","children":"Consistency check"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Household income"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Relevant official records for the requested period"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Use the same people, dates and currency throughout"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Available contribution"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Confirmed family or external support"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Distinguish committed funds from hoped-for help"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Study costs"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"The campus and programme cost estimate"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Keep tuition, living and arrival costs separate"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Funding gap"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Costs less documented available resources"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Explain the calculation in plain language"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
30:["$","section","4-Make leadership evidence specific",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make leadership evidence specific"}],[["$","p","Choose an example where you can describe the problem, your own contribution and what changed. A title such as club president gives little information without the work behind it. Distinguish the team's achievement from the part you personally completed.",{"children":"Choose an example where you can describe the problem, your own contribution and what changed. A title such as club president gives little information without the work behind it. Distinguish the team's achievement from the part you personally completed."}],["$","p","For a fictional tutoring project, useful evidence might be the attendance record you maintained, the teaching material you created and a change you made after feedback. Do not invent a success percentage. Explain what you learned and why the proposed degree helps you address the next problem. Write your own answers to the current form rather than submitting a generic scholarship essay.",{"children":"For a fictional tutoring project, useful evidence might be the attendance record you maintained, the teaching material you created and a change you made after feedback. Do not invent a success percentage. Explain what you learned and why the proposed degree helps you address the next problem. Write your own answers to the current form rather than submitting a generic scholarship essay."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Make leadership evidence specific","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/scholarship-cv/",{"href":"/guides/scholarship-cv/","children":["Prepare a factual scholarship CV",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/recommendation-letter/",{"href":"/guides/recommendation-letter/","children":["Request a useful recommendation",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
31:["$","section","5-Before you press submit",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before you press submit"}],[["$","p","Use the actual portal status to check readiness. A recommendation you requested is still outstanding until the system records its submission.",{"children":"Use the actual portal status to check readiness. A recommendation you requested is still outstanding until the system records its submission."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L34",null,{"id":"scholarships/ubc-international-scholars:section-6","title":"Check your progress","items":["I checked the first-degree, graduation-date and programme rules.","My school confirmed its nomination process and campus allocation.","My nominator and teacher referee are different people.","My UBC admission application is submitted.","Both recommendation forms show completed submission.","Financial figures agree across the documents and form.","I saved the award submission confirmation."]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
32:["$","section","6-After the award application: admission documents and English evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"After the award application: admission documents and English evidence"}],[["$","p","UBC gives International Scholars applicants a 31 January document and English-standard deadline. Read its instructions for records that are not yet available. That later document stage does not extend the extended December award application deadline.",{"children":"UBC gives International Scholars applicants a 31 January document and English-standard deadline. Read its instructions for records that are not yet available. That later document stage does not extend the extended December award application deadline."}],["$","p","Keep a separate task for official delivery: document name, sender, request date and receipt status. Monitor the admissions email as well as the award platform. If invited to a video interview, follow the invitation's response window; do not treat an invitation as an award offer.",{"children":"Keep a separate task for official delivery: document name, sender, request date and receipt status. Monitor the admissions email as well as the award platform. If invited to a video interview, follow the invitation's response window; do not treat an invitation as an award offer."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://you.ubc.ca/financial-planning/scholarships-awards-international-students/international-scholars/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://you.ubc.ca/financial-planning/scholarships-awards-international-students/international-scholars/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"UBC: January documents and later application stages"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
33:["$","section","7-Check the submission, then save the evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the submission, then save the evidence"}],[["$","p","A saved draft and a submitted application are different states. Reopen the application summary, inspect every attachment and check the referee indicators. Keep the confirmation email or reference number with the version of the instructions you used. Put any later transcript, offer-acceptance or enrolment task in a separate calendar entry.",{"children":"A saved draft and a submitted application are different states. Reopen the application summary, inspect every attachment and check the referee indicators. Keep the confirmation email or reference number with the version of the instructions you used. Put any later transcript, offer-acceptance or enrolment task in a separate calendar entry."}],["$","p","The tracker is an editable planning sheet, not an application form or eligibility assessment. Its suggested next actions belong to you; deadlines and requirements remain controlled by the institution. Replace the blank owner, internal deadline and confirmation fields with your own plan.",{"children":"The tracker is an editable planning sheet, not an application form or eligibility assessment. Its suggested next actions belong to you; deadlines and requirements remain controlled by the institution. Replace the blank owner, internal deadline and confirmation fields with your own plan."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Check the submission, then save the evidence","children":[["$","a","/downloads/scholarship-application-tracker-2027.csv",{"href":"/downloads/scholarship-application-tracker-2027.csv","download":true,"children":["Download the scholarship application tracker (CSV)",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/deadline-calendar/",{"href":"/deadline-calendar/","children":["Compare other scholarship deadlines",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
